# GET /api/<contract>: one contract page, in the one form, with its example run now
route     GET /api/<contract>
handler   contract
memo      the contract of GET /api/<contract> on tiesapi.com
input
  <contract>: the name of a file under catalog/contracts/
processing
  1 read the file: route, handler, memo, then input, processing, output, graph, example, versions
  2 the chain: base = sha256 of the page URL and the memo; each version line adds the sha256 of the content, the memo and
    the hash of the link before; head = the last
  3 the graph: the chain, and the contracts this one builds on and is built on by, each by URL and head
  4 run the example requests through the same router, now, and keep the replies
output
  200 {name, url, route, handler, title, memo, input, processing, output, graph, example, content_sha256, sha256, bytes}
  404 {error: "no such contract"}
  check: content_sha256 is the sha256 of the file above "versions"; the last version's content equals it (current)
graph
  builds on contracts
example
  GET /api/receipt
versions
  sha256:e5ab49bf4a65152ad697d6cd000f8a12e4d9fa568325c1488c051fa1495d7950 first version
